{"availability":"available","full":"kj187/jarvis","name":"jarvis","description":"Jarvis is an open source web frontend for Prometheus Alertmanager — interactive, realtime, and self-hosted.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":62,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-05T11:25:14Z","updated":"2026-10-05T17:46:01Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kj187.github.io/jarvis/","topics":["alerting","alertmanager","helm","kubernetes","monitoring","on-call","prometheus","prometheus-alertmanager","self-hosted","sre"],"demo":"https://kj187.github.io/jarvis/demo","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.422Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.422Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.422Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.422Z","stars":62,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Interactive, realtime, self-hosted Alertmanager UI","Jarvis is an open source web frontend for Prometheus Alertmanager — interactive, realtime, and self-hosted.","It was inspired by Karma, which is a great project. However, I was missing features that matter for day-to-day on-call work: full persistence across restarts, the ability to comment on individual alerts, a claiming system so the team knows who is handling what, and a solid foundation to build further operational tooling on top of. Jarvis is the result."],"features":["Realtime alerts via WebSocket — no page reload required","Persistent history — full alert lifecycle stored in SQLite or PostgreSQL, with a grace period that prevents ghost-resolve noise on a missed poll","Claiming & comments — assign an alert to yourself, leave fingerprint-bound notes that survive restarts and re-fires","Multi-cluster & Alertmanager HA — every cluster live in one view; point one cluster at an HA gossip group and alerts are deduplicated by fingerprint","Silences with confidence — live preview of exactly what a silence will hit before you create it, one-click Fast-Silence, reusable templates"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kj187/jarvis/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0797a9d2a5992e265dcb9227c5aa9fb5abda70ff109e8648fd45ad607bb75bd9","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.498Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.498Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Interactive, realtime, self-hosted Alertmanager UI","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kj187/jarvis/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"User authentication — optional UI login: built-in accounts with an admin panel, or any OIDC provider","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kj187/jarvis/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0797a9d2a5992e265dcb9227c5aa9fb5abda70ff109e8648fd45ad607bb75bd9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kj187/jarvis/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.499Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T17:46:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kj187/jarvis/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:20.499Z","hash":"0797a9d2a5992e265dcb9227c5aa9fb5abda70ff109e8648fd45ad607bb75bd9","originalBytes":6854,"storedBytes":6854,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["jarvis","alertmanager","alerts","cluster","full","what","deployment","every","one","see","alert","data","engineering","license","live","realtime","security","auth","authentication","built","claiming","code","comments","compatibility","compose","configuration","container","contributing","does","environment","feature","features","getting","guide","helm","history","interactive","just","kubernetes","need","no-new-privileges","notes","open","podman","postgresql","read","read-only","reference","restarts","run","runs","scope","silences","sqlite","started","them","true","url","via","volumes","ability","about","accounts","across","act","address.","admin","any","apache","api","around","assign","assumptions","audit","auto-refresh","bar","bash","basic","bearer","become","be